WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Find a square of paper. Turn it so a corner points toward you.

00:08.000 --> 00:17.000
Crease both diagonals, opening the paper after each fold.

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
Fold all four tips into the center. You'll have a smaller square.

00:26.000 --> 00:37.000
Fold opposite edges to the center and unfold. Rotate a quarter turn and repeat.

00:37.000 --> 00:47.000
Open two opposite corner flaps. Lift the two folded sides along their creases.

00:47.000 --> 00:56.000
Pinch the corner creases inward. Bring each end flap up and tuck its tip down into the base.

00:56.000 --> 01:02.000
Press the four walls and flatten the base. Your tray is ready.
